# Twitch EventSub webhook handler — example notifications
#
# Endpoint: POST {{TWITCH_API_ENDPOINT}}/twitch/events
# Dispatch is driven by the Twitch-Eventsub-Message-Type header:
#   - webhook_callback_verification : returns the "challenge" as the body
#   - notification                  : resolves the linked account from
#                                     subscription.condition.broadcaster_user_id
#                                     (or to_broadcaster_user_id) and dispatches
#                                     to a TwitchEventHandler
#
# The event types below mirror the subscriptions created by
# oda-twitch-service SubscribeAllEventsHandler.
# broadcaster_user_id must reference an account linked to the twitch service.

### WEBHOOK CALLBACK VERIFICATION (challenge handshake)
POST {{TWITCH_API_ENDPOINT}}/twitch/events HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Twitch-Eventsub-Message-Type: webhook_callback_verification

{
  "challenge": "1c2b3a4d-5e6f-7081-92a3-b4c5d6e7f809",
  "subscription": {
    "type": "channel.follow",
    "condition": {
      "broadcaster_user_id": "161598700"
    }
  }
}

### SENDING FOLLOW EVENT
POST {{TWITCH_API_ENDPOINT}}/twitch/events HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Twitch-Eventsub-Message-Type: notification

{
  "subscription": {
    "type": "channel.follow",
    "condition": {
      "broadcaster_user_id": "161598700"
    }
  },
  "event": {
    "broadcaster_user_id": "161598700",
    "user_name": "testone",
    "followed_at": "2026-01-01T12:00:00Z"
  }
}

### SENDING BAN EVENT
POST {{TWITCH_API_ENDPOINT}}/twitch/events HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Twitch-Eventsub-Message-Type: notification

{
  "subscription": {
    "type": "channel.ban",
    "condition": {
      "broadcaster_user_id": "161598700"
    }
  },
  "event": {
    "broadcaster_user_id": "161598700",
    "user_name": "testone",
    "is_permanent": true
  }
}

