### SENDING SUBSCRIPTION GIFT EVENT
POST {{TWITCH_API_ENDPOINT}}/twitch/events HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Twitch-Eventsub-Message-Type: notification

{
  "subscription": {
    "type": "channel.subscription.gift",
    "condition": {
      "broadcaster_user_id": "161598700"
    }
  },
  "event": {
    "broadcaster_user_id": "161598700",
    "user_name": "testone",
    "tier": "1000",
