### SENDING RAID EVENT
POST {{TWITCH_API_ENDPOINT}}/twitch/events HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Twitch-Eventsub-Message-Type: notification

{
  "subscription": {
    "type": "channel.raid",
    "condition": {
      "from_broadcaster_user_id": "",
      "to_broadcaster_user_id": "175064269"
    }
  },
  "event": {
    "from_broadcaster_user_name": "testone",
    "from_broadcaster_user_id": "886806515",
    "viewers": 100
  }
}

